 <h3><u>Ghar chalo</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Ghar chalo</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Haay, Shaame aashur jab rote rote ghash khaagayi Sakina </font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Khwaab mein dekhti hai Sakina </p> <p>Bhaiya qaasim ka aya he sehra</p> <p>Jab na aaya nazar usko dulha </p> <p>Are maqtal mein usko dhundne nikli woh jaa ba jaa</p> <p>(Nagaah usko laasha-e-qasim nazar aaya) x2</p> <p>(Laashe qasim pe boli Sakina, Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>(Ghar mein shaadi ki masnad bichhi he) x2</li>
    <p>Fatima Kubra dulhan bani he </p>
    <p>Dhoom shaadi ki ran mein machi he </p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Manqabat dada haider ki parh kar) x2</li>
    <p>Haath mein tera sehra utha kar</p>
    <p>Tujhko awaaz deti he khahar </p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Ye ghari mujhko rab ne dikhaayi) x2</li>
    <p>Aaj hai teri rasme hinaai </p>
    <p>Neg mehndi ka dena he bhaai</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Kaisa kubra ka bigra muqaddar) x2</li>
    <p>Siyaah kapre hai uske badan par</p>
    <p>Kyun ye kehti hun mein ban mein ro kar </p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Jis ghari tuta khwaab-e-Sakina) x2</li>
    <p>Khud ko usne sar-e-dasht paaya</p>
    <p>Peet ke sar pukaari woh dukhya</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Hai phupi ke labon par ye nauha) x2</li>
    <p>Hogaya qatl maqtal mein dulha</p>
    <p>Raegaa(n) he mera ab ye kehna </p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Amma farwa ko kaise sambhaalun) x2</li>
    <p>Kis tarha mei tasalli unhe du(n)</p>
    <p>Pehle khud ko ye kehke sambhaalo </p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p>
    <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p>
    <li>(Dasht mein tha jo pur dard manzar) x2</li>
   </ol> <p>Kehrahi paaye irfaano mazhar</p> <p>Kaanpti thi zamee(n) bas ye sunkar </p> <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p> <p>Laashe kaasim pe boli Sakina</p> <p>Ghar chalo bhaai mehndi lagaalo</p></font>
